2560x1440.png", "id": "9694295067292512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499321037_9694295080625844_7058733060244598907_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hCuterpPGowQ7kNvwGCoAXn&_nc_oc=Adqn8Owo-HMx1NGo2KCwT0ieKyje71iye0xgqhrTPkEZPReJ9xKHdmcRzZzEjd4NXe8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUqkFqApm2f6L_Z4BfyN_5JNeRVltPF4ha8CVukmabD2Q&oe=6B0F1AF3"}, "display_name": "SAVE SAM THE LITTLE GREEN MAN", "keywords": [], "long_description": "ARE YOU READY TO SAVE SAM.\n\nStep into a fun Mixed-Reality, Handtracking, Level based game.\nMove around in you own  3D space (3x2 meter) to save SAM, the more Sam\u2019s you save in a level the more SAM\u2019s you get in the next level.\n\nTHE BEST SAVE SAM HELPERS GET'S ON THE ONLINE LEADERBOARD.\n\nHOW MANY SAM'S HAVE YOU SAVED TO DAY?\n\nHave FUN and ENJOY.", "short_description": "ARE YOU READY TO SAVE SAM.\n\nStep into a fun Mixed-Reality, Handtracking, Level based game.\nMove around in you own 3D space (3x2 meter) to save SAM, the more Sam\u2019s you save in a level the more SAM\u2019s you get in the next level.\n\nTHE BEST SAVE SAM HELPERS GET'S ON THE ONLINE LEADERBOARD.\n\nHOW MANY SAM'S HAVE YOU SAVED TO DAY?\n\nHave FUN and ENJOY."}]}, "developer_name": "MANGO CHUTNEY PICTURES", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mangochutney.dk/Save_Sam_The_Little_Green_Mann_Privacy_Policy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MANGO CHUTNEY PICTURES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mangochutney.dk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics"